                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Consider factors like your partner's style, the metal type, and the ring's design details. Think about whether they prefer classic, modern, or intricate designs. Wedding Day Diamonds' experts can guide you through these choices.</p>",
